  "result": "Perfect! All 99 tests pass. I've added automatic tier-based discount support:\n\n**Core addition:**\n\n**`TIER_DISCOUNTS` in `src/customers.js`**\n```javascript\nexport const TIER_DISCOUNTS = {\n  gold: 5,\n  silver: 2.5,\n  standard: 0,\n};\n```\n\n**Updated `createInvoice`:**\n- For each line without an explicit `discountPercent`, applies the customer's tier discount\n- A line's own `discountPercent` (even if 0) always wins over tier discount\n- Detects explicit values using `'discountPercent' in line` to distinguish between \"not provided\" and \"provided as 0\"\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Gold tier customers get 5% automatic discount on lines\n- Silver tier customers get 2.5% automatic discount on lines\n- Standard tier customers get 0% automatic discount (no discount)\n- Explicit discounts override tier discounts: `{ sku, qty, discountPercent: 0 }` gives 0% even for gold customers\n\n**Example:**\n```javascript\ncreateInvoice({\n  customerId: 'C-001',  // gold tier\n  issueDate: '2026-10-07',\n  lines: [\n    { sku: 'DEV-HOUR', qty: 10 },        // gets 5% tier discount\n    { sku: 'LOGO-PACK', qty: 1, discountPercent: 0 },  // explicit 0, no discount\n    { sku: 'COPY-HOUR', qty: 5, discountPercent: 15 }  // explicit 15%, overrides tier\n  ]\n})\n```\n\n**Test coverage:** 8 new tests covering:\n- Each tier's default discount\n- Tier discount override with explicit values\n- Mixed lines with and without tier discounts\n- Effect on invoice totals\n\nAll 99 tests pass \u2713",
